#: ../../administration/logging/log_forwarding.rst:83
msgid ""
"Log forwarding traffic flows directly from managed hosts to the syslog "
"receiver. Ensure all managed hosts have network access to the syslog "
"destination — not just the |morpheus| appliance."
msgstr ""
"Le trafic de transfert de journaux circule directement des hôtes gérés "
"vers le récepteur syslog. Assurez-vous que tous les hôtes gérés "
"disposent d'un accès réseau à la destination syslog — pas seulement "
"l'appliance |morpheus|."

